---
title: Four constraints, and the structure each one forces
---
flowchart LR
    C1["a PreToolUse hook,<br/>on every governed<br/>tool call"] --> S1["one process per call<br/>no daemon<br/>no cache between calls"]
    C2["standard library only<br/>dependencies = []"] --> S2["config parsing, matching,<br/>locking and logging<br/>all written in-tree"]
    C3["no hand-rolled<br/>bash parsing"] --> S3["one PEG grammar,<br/>the only structural parser<br/>413 lines of .peg,<br/>6,536 generated"]
    C4["never leave Claude Code<br/>without a decision"] --> S4["every governed path emits<br/>JSON on stdout; an unforeseen<br/>error denies, not silence"]

